  "jp": "依頼を引き受けるか選べます。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "you can choose whether to accept it."
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0008:00",
  "jp": "ただし、引き受けられる依頼は",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "However, you can only accept"
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0009:00",
  "jp": "同時に６つ（６人）までです。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "up to 6 quests (6 clients) at once."
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0010:00",
  "jp": "同じ依頼人からは同時に１つしか",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "You can only take 1 quest at a time"
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0011:00",
  "jp": "依頼を受けることはできません。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "from the same client."
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0013:00",
  "jp": "また、同じ部屋で行う依頼を",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Also, you can't take multiple quests"
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0014:00",
  "jp": "同時に複数受けることもできません。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "set in the same room at once."
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0017:00",
  "jp": "【依頼を確認】",
