  "jp": "「ダウンロード」→「依頼を探す」から",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "go to \"Download\" -> \"Find Quests\"."
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0087:00",
  "jp": "※ただし、ダウンロードでは",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "*Note: with downloads, you can only"
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0088:00",
  "jp": "同時に１つの依頼しか受けられません。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "take 1 quest at a time."
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0090:00",
  "jp": "また、保存できる依頼カードは",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Also, you can save up to 8"
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0091:00",
  "jp": "同時に８つまでです。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "quest cards at once."
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0092:00",
  "jp": "データを削除した場合は、",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "If you delete the data,"
 },
 {
  "id": "questwordcomment:0093:00",
  "jp": "再びダウンロードしてください。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "please download it again."
 }
]
